{
  "name": "stage-resume-index",
  "note": "P1-4 (SDD persona goalpost): startPerform() from the setlist's Start button hardcoded index 0, so closing the Stage mid-setlist and reopening always threw the performer back to song 1 instead of where they left off. Fixture: a 3-song seeded setlist (catalog ids k0/k1/k2). Journey: Start -> Next -> Next (now on song 3 of 3) -> Close -> Start again -> assert the Stage reopens on song 3 of 3, not song 1. Red-first: pre-fix the reopen always lands on '1 / 3'. VOLLEY-1: extended past the unchanged-setlist case, which could not see either of the two index bugs codex found - completing a set left the index on the LAST song, and editing the setlist left a stale index pointing at a different song.",
  "viewport": {
    "width": 412,
    "height": 915
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "action": "goto",
      "path": "/music/play/"
    },
    {
      "action": "wait",
      "ms": 700
    },
    {
      "action": "evalAssert",
      "label": "seed a 3-song setlist from the catalog",
      "js": "(function(){try{localStorage.setItem('roadcase-ukulele-gcea.setlist.v1', JSON.stringify(['k0','k1','k2']));return true}catch(e){return false}})()"
    },
    {
      "action": "goto",
      "path": "/music/play/"
    },
    {
      "action": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "action": "tap",
      "selector": ".tabbar [data-tab=\"jam\"]"
    },
    {
      "action": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "action": "tap",
      "selector": "#performBtn"
    },
    {
      "action": "wait",
      "ms": 600
    },
    {
      "action": "evalAssert",
      "label": "Stage opens fresh on song 1 of 3",
      "js": "(function(){var p=document.getElementById('pPos');return !!p && p.textContent.trim().indexOf('1 / 3')===0;})()"
    },
    {
      "action": "tap",
      "selector": "#pNext"
    },
    {
      "action": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "action": "tap",
      "selector": "#pNext"
    },
    {
      "action": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "action": "evalAssert",
      "label": "advanced to song 3 of 3 mid-set",
      "js": "(function(){var p=document.getElementById('pPos');return !!p && p.textContent.trim().indexOf('3 / 3')===0;})()"
    },
    {
      "action": "tap",
      "selector": "#pClose"
    },
    {
      "action": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "action": "evalAssert",
      "label": "Stage closed",
      "js": "(function(){var p=document.getElementById('perform');return !p || !p.classList.contains('on');})()"
    },
    {
      "action": "tap",
      "selector": "#performBtn"
    },
    {
      "action": "wait",
      "ms": 600
    },
    {
      "action": "evalAssert",
      "label": "re-opening Start resumes at song 3 of 3, not back at song 1 (FAILS pre-fix: startPerform(...,0) hardcodes index 0)",
      "js": "(function(){var p=document.getElementById('pPos');return !!p && p.textContent.trim().indexOf('3 / 3')===0;})()"
    },
    {
      "action": "tap",
      "selector": "#pClose"
    },
    {
      "action": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "action": "evalAssert",
      "label": "EDIT the setlist between sessions - remove the first song (this is what the old fixture never did)",
      "js": "(function(){try{var k='roadcase-ukulele-gcea.setlist.v1';var cur=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(k)||'[]');cur.shift();localStorage.setItem(k,JSON.stringify(cur));return cur.length===2;}catch(e){return false}})()"
    },
    {
      "action": "goto",
      "path": "/music/play/"
    },
    {
      "action": "wait",
      "ms": 900
    },
    {
      "action": "tap",
      "selector": ".tabbar [data-tab=\"jam\"]"
    },
    {
      "action": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "action": "tap",
      "selector": "#performBtn"
    },
    {
      "action": "wait",
      "ms": 700
    },
    {
      "action": "evalAssert",
      "label": "RED GOALPOST (volley-1 high): after a setlist EDIT the stored index is dropped - Start opens at song 1 of 2, not at a stale position pointing into a different setlist",
      "js": "(function(){var p=document.getElementById('pPos');return !!p && /\\b1\\s*\\/\\s*2\\b/.test(p.textContent||'');})()"
    },
    {
      "action": "tap",
      "selector": "#pNext"
    },
    {
      "action": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "action": "evalAssert",
      "label": "advance to the last song, then finish the set with the tick",
      "js": "(function(){var p=document.getElementById('pPos');return !!p && /\\b2\\s*\\/\\s*2\\b/.test(p.textContent||'');})()"
    },
    {
      "action": "tap",
      "selector": "#pNext"
    },
    {
      "action": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "action": "tap",
      "selector": "#performBtn"
    },
    {
      "action": "wait",
      "ms": 700
    },
    {
      "action": "evalAssert",
      "label": "RED GOALPOST (volley-1 high): a COMPLETED set resumes at the top - finishing with the tick must not leave the index parked on the last song",
      "js": "(function(){var p=document.getElementById('pPos');return !!p && /\\b1\\s*\\/\\s*2\\b/.test(p.textContent||'');})()"
    },
    {
      "action": "screenshot",
      "name": "stage-resume-after-edit"
    },
    {
      "action": "screenshot",
      "name": "stage-resume-index"
    }
  ]
}